WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.440
Welcome to our training.

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:04.320
Add offers to products already in Amazon's catalog.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.580
You'll need to upload and list your products in Seller Central to sell them in the Amazon store.

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:17.161
In this video, we'll review step-by-step instructions for listing products one at a time

00:00:17.161 --> 00:00:19.080
using the Add Products tool.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:24.260
To begin adding products, click the menu icon in the top left hand corner.

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:28.120
Hover over Catalog, then click Add Products.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:31.360
You'll be redirected to the List Your Products page.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:36.200
On this page, you'll be provided with six different options to list a product.

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:42.691
In this training, we will cover the three options you can use to list a product sold in the Amazon

00:00:42.691 --> 00:00:42.980
store.

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:47.100
Search, product IDs, and web URL.

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:50.774
For more information on how to use these tabs,

00:00:50.774 --> 00:00:55.300
watch the additional videos in the More Information section in Seller University.

00:00:55.900 --> 00:01:00.420
Let's start with the product IDs and web URL options.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.075
For the product IDs option,

00:01:03.075 --> 00:01:09.420
you can search for the product by using the UPC, EAN, ISBN, or ASIN ID.

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:11.538
For the web URL,

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:18.190
you can copy and paste the link to the product directly from the Amazon store or other manufacturer's

00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:18.560
website.

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:24.040
Once you've entered either the product ID or web URL, click Submit.

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:25.862
For the product ID,

00:01:25.862 --> 00:01:30.000
if you're eligible to sell the product, you'll be taken to the Offer page.

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:31.826
For the web URL,

00:01:31.826 --> 00:01:37.460
you'll be taken to the Complete Your Drafts page, where you'll need to click Review and Submit.

00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:42.300
Then, if you're eligible to sell the product, you'll be taken to the Offer page.

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:44.140
On this page,

00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:50.300
you'll fill out the contribution SKU, quantity, your price, offering condition type, and fulfillment

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:50.740
channel.

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:56.247
Then, select other marketplaces in which you want to list the product and click Save and

00:01:56.247 --> 00:01:56.560
Finish.

00:01:57.040 --> 00:02:02.097
If you're not eligible, you'll either see Not Available, which means you can't list the

00:02:02.097 --> 00:02:08.166
product, or Apply to Sell, which means you need to be approved to sell this item before creating

00:02:08.166 --> 00:02:08.503
the

00:02:08.503 --> 00:02:08.840
offer.

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:13.540
You can click on Apply to Sell to access the approval process.

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:15.935
If you select the Search

00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:21.016
option to match to an existing listing, you'll enter either the product title, description,

00:02:21.016 --> 00:02:26.460
or the keywords that best describe your product in the search bar and click Submit.

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:30.300
On the next page, search for the product you're listing.

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:33.041
You can also use the options under the

00:02:33.041 --> 00:02:38.180
Narrow by category or Narrow by Brand sections to help narrow down your search results.

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:39.333
After

00:02:39.333 --> 00:02:44.980
you've located the product you'd like to list, choose its condition and select Sell this product.

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:48.272
If not available, appears next to your product.

00:02:48.272 --> 00:02:51.085
Select the Show Limitations drop-down menu to

00:02:51.085 --> 00:02:54.600
review the reason and click Learn More for further details.

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:57.680
If you see an Apply to Sell button next

00:02:57.680 --> 00:03:02.880
to a product, it means that it requires approval before you can sell it in the Amazon store.

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:08.830
Select the button to open a selling application, which you'll use to apply to get approval to list

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:10.640
the product in the Amazon store.

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:15.120
Select the menu icon in the top left corner of Seller Central.

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:21.560
Hover over Catalog and click View Selling Applications to see the status of your applications.

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:28.128
Once approved, you can list your product in the condition you chose, or if you're declined,

00:03:28.128 --> 00:03:30.560
you can click Reapply.

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:34.222
After you've selected your product, enter your Offer Information in

00:03:34.222 --> 00:03:35.320
the Offer section.

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:40.200
We've marked all required fields with an asterisk symbol, but recommend

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:43.000
you also complete the Contribution SKU field.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:47.453
You can add your own item number or a unique

00:03:47.453 --> 00:03:53.235
identifier you use to categorize your products to easily compare what you've listed in Seller Central

00:03:53.235 --> 00:03:54.680
to your own records.

00:03:55.480 --> 00:04:00.144
Contribution SKUs are also often used by third-party integration tools

00:04:00.144 --> 00:04:01.840
to tie systems together.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:06.691
If you leave this field blank, we'll generate a random alphanumeric SKU

00:04:06.691 --> 00:04:07.440
for you.

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:12.909
Keep in mind that you won't be able to change the product SKU after you click the Save

00:04:12.909 --> 00:04:13.760
and Finish button.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:19.089
You can select Required, Recommended, or All Attributes using the Attributes

00:04:19.089 --> 00:04:21.560
filter on the left-hand side.

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:25.752
You'll also be able to add attributes to your Offer after you've

00:04:25.752 --> 00:04:27.800
matched it to the product's Detail page.

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:31.729
When you've completed the required fields, as well as any

00:04:31.729 --> 00:04:35.580
optional fields, click the Save and Finish button to match your Offer.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.513
This concludes our training,

00:04:37.513 --> 00:04:40.540
Add offers to products already in Amazon's catalog.

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:43.600
Thank you and happy selling in the Amazon Store.
